# Line endings: files that end up on Linux (Docker build context, deploy
# scripts, nginx snippets) must stay LF. Without this, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites them to CRLF and the shell scripts fail on the
# server with `bash: /usr/bin/env: bad interpreter: No such file or directory`.
*.sh                text eol=lf
Dockerfile          text eol=lf
Dockerfile.*        text eol=lf
*.conf              text eol=lf
docker-compose*.yml text eol=lf
